<title>USA: Barney's wins extension on exclusivity period.</title>
<headline>Barney's wins extension on exclusivity period.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A U.S. bankruptcy court judge has granted upscale retailer Barney's Inc a 90-day extension for the exclusive right to file a reorganization plan, a company spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The move extends the exclusivity period until May 5, she said.</p>
<p>Barney's said last week that it is negotiating with Dickson Concepts Ltd and at least two other potential parties regarding an investment.</p>
<p>Barney's has been operating in bankruptcy since last January.</p>
<p>((--Robin Sidel, 212/859-1723))</p>
